        }
      ],
      "title": "神秘拍卖·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "31025001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "那么，现在……就交给我们吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31025002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "还愣着干什么？难道要我一个人给她们换衣服吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "31025004",
              "text": "哎？你是在说我吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "31025003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31025004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "不然呢！快来快来~\n看在你送给我工具箱的份上，我就让你见识一下我的改装绝技！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31025005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "准备好了吗，|101|？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31025006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "你们不会说的是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31025007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "等、等一下……唔啊！不要扯这个！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31025008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "……我自己来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31026001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "当当~完成啦……快夸我快夸我！\n真恋，要挺胸抬头，你可是喵爪帮的大小姐，拿出大当家的气势来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31026002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "好漂亮……我喜欢这个裙子~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31026003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "小姐，照镜子的时间结束了，我们该出发了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31026004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "萝贝卡。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31026005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "……干什么……我，我不会乱来的！\n酒井唯会看着我的，我……我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31026006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "……注意安全。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31026007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "啊……哦，我知道了……酒井唯会罩着我的，不会有事的，放心吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31026008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "梅根",
          "text": "那就好……小家伙，你来了，我很开心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31026009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "梅根……呜哇啊啊啊啊梅根！！！\n我还以为你不要我了呜！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31026010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "酒井唯",
          "text": "走了萝贝卡，别丢人了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31027001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "那边就是拍卖会入口了吗？\n啧，幸好我把车车也改造了一下，不然就要穿帮了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31027002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贼快滴车",
          "text": "万分感谢您的改装！本次服务就不收费啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31027003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "拍卖会保安在检查邀请函，可是，我们没有啊……这可怎么办?",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "31027004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克莱儿",
          "text": "我先去看一下情况，你们在这里等我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-675",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "claire",
